        <mxCell id="iamnote" value="&lt;b&gt;Core device role&lt;/b&gt; (temporary credentials via the Token exchange service; nothing is stored in the container)&lt;br&gt;ECR pull: ecr:GetAuthorizationToken, ecr:BatchGetImage, ecr:GetDownloadUrlForLayer, ecr:BatchCheckLayerAvailability (repository opcua-data-sim)&lt;br&gt;S3: s3:GetObject on opcua-data-sim-samples-&amp;lt;region&amp;gt;-&amp;lt;account&amp;gt;/*&lt;br&gt;If SiteWise Edge runs on this core: iotsitewise:BatchPutAssetPropertyValue on time-series/*, condition propertyAlias /opcua-sim/*" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#232F3E;align=left;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=4;fillColor=#FFEBEE;strokeColor=#DD344C;spacingLeft=70;" vertex="1" parent="1">
